{"id":"n64545-1-10","stage":2,"title":"들려주다 · 给人听","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64545-1-10-1","ko":"지난번에 네가 들려준 음악 말인데 제목이 뭐야?","zh":"上次你给我听的那首歌，叫什么名字啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난번에","meaning":"上次，上回","explanation":"지난번：上次，上回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지난번","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71316","senseId":"1","lemma":"지난번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난번에","audio":"/audio/00bddae7b7dbaea35dd2.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"들려준","meaning":"给人听，告诉","explanation":"들려주다：给人听，告诉；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"들려주다","audio":"/audio/448606e28f3113feee56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64545","senseId":"1","lemma":"들려주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들려준","audio":"/audio/3980f785a765ccf806e6.mp3"}},{"text":"음악","meaning":"音乐","explanation":"음악：音乐。","readings":[{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71115","senseId":"1","lemma":"음악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}},{"text":"말인데","meaning":"就是那个","explanation":"말：就是那个；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"10","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말인데","audio":"/audio/1b221d89e8d00d6a8e81.mp3"}},{"text":"제목이","meaning":"题目","explanation":"제목：题目；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"제목","audio":"/audio/08b17e433630742bc700.mp3"}],"sources":[